cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: tekmerion
abstract: >-
  An MCP server for biomedical evidence from PubMed, Europe PMC, ClinicalTrials.gov and
  openFDA. Every passage it returns carries a handle whose check code is a truncated keyed
  MAC over the passage's locator, so the installation that issued it can tell a genuine
  citation from a fabricated one, and a deterministic audit checks each citation of an
  answer: malformed, forged, unavailable, withdrawn, misquoted or valid, with flags for
  retracted, preprint and outdated sources.
authors:
  - family-names: Markovicz
    given-names: Pedro
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-6878-793X"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/PedroMarkovicz/tekmerion"
url: "https://pedromarkovicz.github.io/tekmerion/"
keywords:
  - mcp
  - citations
  - biomedical
  - pubmed
  - llm
  - provenance
